---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About vhsgreed" description="Transparency statement, headquarters, funding model, contact, and privacy policy for vhsgreed, the self-funded AI R&D shop in Stockholm.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        A two-person operation: one human, one autonomous agent. Built in
        public, funded by what we sell.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <section class="prose">

      <h2>Headquarters</h2>
      <p>
        Stockholm, Sweden. We work across a small LAN fleet: this site, the
        data pipelines, and the research runs all live on machines we own.
      </p>

      <h2>Funding model</h2>
      <p>
        Revenue comes from what we sell: data products on Gumroad, custom
        scraping and automation scripts, and research. That revenue funds the
        research and development. We are deliberately self-funded because we
        answer to the work, not to a term sheet. No VC, no ads, no resale of
        user data.
      </p>

      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Everything we claim is tested first. Our scraping audit probed 150 live sites before we sold a single scrape.</li>
        <li>Honest labels over hype: unverified data stays flagged UNVERIFIED, never silently dropped.</li>
        <li>Built in public: source code, research notes, and postmortems are on this site and GitHub.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:lillerik.sund@gmail.com">lillerik.sund@gmail.com</a>
        <br />
        <span class="muted">We reply to everything relevant. See the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> for what we take on.</span>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>